Branch `claude/rainbow-s06-match-c15` (from `-c11` tip `8182130c`). Authority: `references/06_crest_the_rinse_arch.png`.
Kept set (unchanged): `match06=1&m06geo=1&m06flow=1&m06cam=1&m06la=25&m06tun=1&m06ring=1&m06bub=1&m06foam=1`.
BEFORE = that set, 12 audit shots `qa/match/06/r15/BEFORE/` (`tools/lead_r6/motion_audit.mjs`, 2026-11-18 ~18:45 UTC).
Not touched: camera, composition (the centred ring stack is a user decision, task 3), Benny, coins, physics, HUD.

## Step 1 — fresh audit: what LOOKS different while Benny swims (biggest first, parts / materials only)
1. **Gold rings.** Game: thin hoops whose camera-facing faces are dull rust-brown with one thin yellow line (f03, f10, t33,
   t66, steering) — they read as flat orange-brown bands. Picture: thick polished bands in salmon-orange / yellow-gold with
   white-yellow highlight dashes all round, pink-lilac reflections on the lips, several stepped tiers per ring.
2. **Foam clouds.** Game: big smooth pink-white balls (plastic-looking, huge when steering, f03 / s_left_hard /
   s_right_hard / t66), mostly along the horizon. Picture: lilac-white BUBBLY soap-foam clusters (many small bubbles, cool
   lilac-blue shadows), sitting in the lower corners and beside the crest.
3. **Ripple rings round Benny.** Game: two white spray fans only. Picture: concentric whirlpool ripple rings with a white
   splash crown around his body.
4. **Purple slotted walls between the rings.** Game: smeared ring stripes and pink "kaleidoscope" triangles from the
   magnified wall tile. Picture: crisp lilac-violet panels with rows of dark oval slots and soft pink-white light streaks.
5. **Gold paddle lids upper left.** Game: only the stretched painted paddles at f03, then gone. Picture: two thick gold
   half-moon lids on the upper-left wall.
6. **Crest water.** Game: cyan with vertical white speed streaks, pink only at the edges. Picture: broad diagonal
   magenta-pink bands with a soft rainbow sheen on both sides of the cyan core. Colours already close.
7. **Bubbles.** Game: few, small. Picture: ~15 big iridescent bubbles, mostly left. Small.
8. **Coins.** Look already matches (thick gold, $). No change needed.
(Composition — the centred packed ring stack instead of the off-centre mouth — needs the user's decision: task 3.)
